    "details": "Confirms the pattern that UEVR alone gets you head tracking and stereo 3D \"for free\" on most UE4/5 titles, but natural interaction (aiming, driving, weapon handling) usually needs a game-specific compatibility plugin layered on top. Only works with the Steam build of the remaster — the Epic Games Store and Rockstar Launcher versions are explicitly unsupported, which is a common asymmetry across UEVR-based mods depending on how each storefront build is packaged.",
