    "blockers": "Crowbar melee swinging can be unreliable and is explicitly still WIP; performance can be poor in open/complex scenes; crossbow scope aiming does not currently work; TAU cannon particle effects can visually glitch and appear to emit from the player's eyes; two-handed weapon support and manual reloading are both planned but not yet implemented; the left hand renders even before the HEV suit is acquired in the intro.",
