    "details": "MULTIPLAYER: an IL patch in `CameraModePlayerBasic.ApplyLookInputInternal` replaces the value assigned to `RoR2.Networking.NetworkedViewAngles.viewAngles` with pitch/yaw computed from `Camera.main.transform.forward`. Local VR projectile/skill hooks are guarded by local-body checks, so existing RoR2 gameplay/network authority remains untouched. No custom hand/body packet, interpolation or remote VR-avatar reconstruction appears in this source.",
