    "details": "VERIFIED FROM SOURCE. SigScanner::UpdateOffset first tests the signature at the expected Offset+SignatureOffset; on mismatch it scans the whole executable image and rewrites Offset/Address when found. Hook<T>::CreateHook refuses to create a MinHook target when signature resolution fails. Indirect globals use the same scanned anchor plus a byte displacement. Hooks::EnableAllHooks also suspends other process threads while applying direct executable patches, then resumes them. The scanner is therefore a reusable compatibility layer for function hooks and discovered globals.",
