    "details": "DFUVR builds as a BepInEx plugin and ships additional GameFolderFiles alongside the DLL. Its setup exposes calibration for player height and scabbard position, plus settings for height, headset refresh rate, controller profile and sheath offset. The useful implementation lesson is that physical weapon placement should be calibrated independently from global player height. UI compatibility is a separate deployment constraint: the README requires a 1920x1080 monitor because the existing UI otherwise becomes unusable, while the VR laser pointer loses precision near UI edges. A 3D ray can therefore be correct while still failing against legacy screen-space UI coordinates.",
