    "details": "RENDERING: D3D compositor creation records the application’s original DXGI format, maps it to linear and sRGB variants, then interprets `Texture_t.eColorSpace`: Gamma selects sRGB, Linear selects linear, Auto uses bits-per-channel heuristics (<=8 bpc assumes gamma). The resulting runtime-supported format is used for the OpenXR swapchain; compatibility checks recreate the chain when size/format assumptions change.\n\nIMPLEMENTATION USE: API translation must carry **color interpretation**, not only pixel layout. Build a format metadata table that can map source formats to target linear/sRGB equivalents and recreate resources when that semantic changes.\n\nSOURCE AUDIT FILES: `OpenOVR/Compositor/dx11compositor.cpp`, `dx12compositor.cpp`, GL/Vulkan compositor format logic.",
    "sourceLinks": "https://gitlab.com/znixian/OpenOVR/-/tree/openxr",
    "submittedBy": "source-audit",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-07"
