    "details": "ARCHITECTURE / WEAPON / PHYSICAL INTERACTION — VERIFIED PAK EVIDENCE: VRGrabInfo serializes separate left/right grip transforms, support-handle transform, primary/secondary dummy-hand transforms, magazine transform, reload-component transform and rail-latch transform. VRItemInfo separately records OriginalActor, custom/preview actors, main skeletal and secondary static meshes, Weight, 2Handle and ReloadComp. VRHolsterInfo carries the bound holster, relative holster transform and return-on-ungrab policy.\n\nARCHITECTURE / WEAPON / PHYSICAL INTERACTION — PORTABLE IMPLEMENTATION RECIPE: For a new port, define ItemVRData keyed by stable native item identity. Store local grip anchors independently from cosmetic wrist poses and mechanism anchors. Resolve world anchors by composing the item world transform with each local anchor; obtain a local calibration by applying the inverse item transform to a measured world pose. Keep native item ownership on the original actor even if a separate mesh is needed for VR presentation. Build generic grab/reload/holster handlers against this contract, then add per-item data instead of duplicating handlers.\n\nARCHITECTURE / WEAPON / PHYSICAL INTERACTION — VALIDATION: Check each anchor with a visible axis marker, then rotate and move the weapon: the anchor must remain rigidly attached. Repeat for both hands and for native versus proxy meshes. These transform equations are a proposed portable implementation, not recovered Blueprint expression order.\n\nSOURCE EVIDENCE: Ready or Not VRO, supplied `pakchunk98-VR_OR_NOT_P.pak`; cooked-package metadata audit, 2026-09-07. References below were checked as length-prefixed serialized strings, including their byte offsets in the extracted .uasset. They establish symbols, data fields and references; the proposed recipe is not a bytecode decompilation.\n\nSOURCE ASSETS: `/Game/VR_OR_NOT/Assets/Components/VRGrabInfo`: `RelativeGrabTransformL_9_09D66C9F466349AE41763FA5E49C27BB` (string offset 0x2C7), `RelativeRailLatchTransform_17_6566945847CEF4851381CBA50F30A1D0` (string offset 0x38C), `RelativeDummySecHandTransform_23_B77202D847F386F360BA359CFE0C6141` (string offset 0x27D). `/Game/VR_OR_NOT/Assets/Components/VRItemInfo`: `OriginalActor_42_5613128D42CC91D33D77E583F62F0211` (string offset 0x206), `Weight_22_325D51C446BE8495F06C25B4DE253065` (string offset 0x44F), `VRON_PreviewActor_34_9558A4664DBC47C07BB8BA9BC1D45515` (string offset 0x3CA). `/Game/VR_OR_NOT/Assets/Components/VRHolsterInfo`: `ReturnToHolsterOnUngrab_6_C2470E734E07DDEB42925997BA1CEFB4` (string offset 0x1F6).",
