    "summary": "Convert unrestricted controller motion into bounded travel along an authored mechanism rail.",
    "details": "WEAPON RELOAD / PHYSICAL INTERACTION / HANDS — VERIFIED PAK EVIDENCE: Both BP_VRMagazine and VRON_ChargeHandle contain ManageRail, Spline, GetLocationAtSplinePoint, FindClosestPointOnSegment and NearlyEqual_TransformTransform. The magazine has Aligned, Latched, LatchLocation and MagFitsGun state; the handle has HoldingHandle, BoltLatch, NeedToCock, NeedToPullPHandle, StageReload, PlayedSound and Reset. The charge-handle package references VInterpTo and the HK416_Bolt audio event.\n\nWEAPON RELOAD / PHYSICAL INTERACTION / HANDS — PORTABLE IMPLEMENTATION RECIPE: A portable solver can transform the tracked hand into mechanism-local space, then compute t=clamp(dot(hand-A,B-A)/dot(B-A,B-A),0,1). Set the sliding point to A+t*(B-A), preserving the authored orientation. Reject a zero-length rail. Use separate approach/alignment, captured travel, end-stop and release states. Snap the visual hand to the mechanism target while retaining the unconstrained controller pose for release distance. Send a chamber/reload intent only on the appropriate state transition.\n\nWEAPON RELOAD / PHYSICAL INTERACTION / HANDS — VALIDATION: Test angled approaches, lateral motion, reversal halfway through travel, release before the end-stop and release at the end-stop. Guard one-shot sound/haptic events with transitions. Formula, tolerances and transition ordering here are adaptation guidance; the recovered metadata verifies the rail helpers and state vocabulary.\n\nSOURCE EVIDENCE: Ready or Not VRO, supplied `pakchunk98-VR_OR_NOT_P.pak`; cooked-package metadata audit, 2026-09-07. References below were checked as length-prefixed serialized strings, including their byte offsets in the extracted .uasset. They establish symbols, data fields and references; the proposed recipe is not a bytecode decompilation.\n\nSOURCE ASSETS: `/Game/VR_OR_NOT/Assets/GunRelated/BP_VRMagazine`: `ManageRail` (string offset 0x18DF), `FindClosestPointOnSegment` (string offset 0x311C), `Latched` (string offset 0x174B), `MagFitsGun` (string offset 0x1837). `/Game/VR_OR_NOT/Assets/GunRelated/VRON_ChargeHandle`: `ManageRail` (string offset 0xCB7), `FindClosestPointOnSegment` (string offset 0x1DB8), `NeedToCock` (string offset 0xD0A), `PlayedSound` (string offset 0xE38).",
